{"seq":5,"slug":"frontier-safety-frameworks","title":"前沿安全框架","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-frontier-research","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前沿安全框架\">前沿安全框架</h1><p>当一家实验室宣布「我们的新模型通过了安全评估」，这句话背后是一整套你未必见过的机器：能力阈值怎么定义、谁来评测、达标与否如何裁决、承诺被违反时会发生什么。本 hub 就是把这台机器完整拆开——从三大实验室的框架文本，到阈值与安全标准的工程解剖，再到各国法律对这套自愿体系的收编，最后落到批评者的火力点与从业者能直接执行的检查清单。</p>\n<p>四条主线按递进关系组织。第一章「框架版图」讲历史与格局：负责任扩展承诺为何在 2023 年集中出现，Anthropic 的 ASL 层级如何演进到 2026 年的重写，OpenAI 与 Google DeepMind 又各自给出了什么变体。第二章「核心机制」下沉到技术层：所有框架共用的「阈值—触发—响应」语法有什么结构性弱点，权重保护与部署标准各防哪条威胁线，第三方评估接口长什么样。第三章「监管交汇」看法律如何接手：欧盟把框架文体翻译成义务与罚则，美国用行政令摆动加州法拼图应对，国际网络则在峰会序列里艰难推进互认。第四章「批判与实践」回到地面：自愿性与执行缺口的四条批评主线，沙箱化部署的运行时现实，以及一张五阶段从业者检查清单。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：按章节顺序通读是最完整的路线，四章分别回答「这是什么」「它怎么运转」「谁在外面推它」「它靠不靠谱」。时间有限的工程师可以走捷径——第一章只读 Anthropic 一篇建立框架感，直入第二章的阈值与安全标准两篇，最后以前三章的概念基础读第四章的检查清单。政策研究方向的读者则应把重心放在第三章全章加批判一章。前置要求很低：不需要机器学习训练经验，但对大模型的基本工作方式（预训练产出权重、通过 API 提供服务、能力随算力扩展）有直觉即可；文中出现的少量公式都做了完整的文字解释。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的边界</strong>：本 hub 聚焦前沿模型的<strong>安全治理体系</strong>——承诺结构、评估机制、监管交汇与落地实践，不覆盖研发侧的技术纵深，也不重复 AGI 的概念之争。同类别下的兄弟 hub 各管一段：AGI 定义之争讨论「什么叫通用人工智能」的概念分歧；缩放定律与苦涩教训解释能力为什么持续增长——那正是本 hub 第一章承诺史的技术前提；预训练数据工程、RLVR 可验证奖励训练与 AI for Science 分别覆盖数据管线、训练方法与科学应用。它们回答「怎么造出来」，本 hub 回答「造出来之后如何负责任地放行」——两边合起来才是前沿 AI 研究的全景。以下延伸阅读入口均为可选，本 hub 内容完全自包含。</p>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读（可选的跨 hub 入口）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../agi-frontier/agi-definitions-debates/\">AGI 定义与争论</a>：概念之争与本 hub 的治理视角互为背景。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../agi-frontier/scaling-laws-bitter-lesson/\">缩放定律与苦涩教训</a>：理解能力增长曲线的第一课。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../pretraining-data-engineering/\">预训练数据工程</a>：研发侧的数据管线纵深。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/\">RLVR 可验证奖励训练</a>：训练方法侧的最新范式。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ai-for-science-discovery/\">AI for Science</a>：能力兑现为科学产出的正面叙事。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landscape","title":"框架版图","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/landscape","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-frameworks-emerged","title":"框架为何出现：负责任扩展承诺史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/landscape/why-frameworks-emerged"},{"seq":2,"slug":"anthropic-asl","title":"Anthropic RSP 与 ASL 层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/landscape/anthropic-asl"},{"seq":3,"slug":"openai-googlemind-frameworks","title":"OpenAI 准备度框架与 Google DeepMind 前沿安全框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/landscape/openai-googlemind-frameworks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-mechanisms","title":"核心机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capability-thresholds-triggers","title":"能力阈值与触发条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms/capability-thresholds-triggers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"security-standards","title":"安全标准：权重保护与内部部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms/security-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"third-party-evaluations","title":"第三方评估与红队接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms/third-party-evaluations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"regulatory-nexus","title":"监管交汇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/regulatory-nexus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eu-ai-act-gpai","title":"EU AI Act 的 GPAI 义务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/regulatory-nexus/eu-ai-act-gpai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"us-policy-architecture","title":"美国政策架构与 AISI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/regulatory-nexus/us-policy-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-network","title":"国际网络与互认尝试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/regulatory-nexus/international-network"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"critiques-practice","title":"批判与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/critiques-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"framework-critiques","title":"对框架的批评：自愿性与执行缺口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/critiques-practice/framework-critiques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sandboxed-deployment","title":"沙箱化部署实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/critiques-practice/sandboxed-deployment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"practitioner-checklist","title":"从业者检查清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/critiques-practice/practitioner-checklist"}]}]}